{"name":"Blood Songs","type":"skill","img":"systems/rmu/icons/svg/iron_crown_w.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"healing-song-blood","collection":"merp-rmu","source":"RMSS/RMFRP — Healing Songs","restriction":{"race":"elf"},"resultTable":"healing-songs","englishName":"Blood Songs","compendiumSourceKey":"healing-song-blood","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-skills","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/khazad.json","compendiumFolderKey":"skills","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Chant du Sang","system":{"name":"Chant du Sang","description":"<h1>Chant du Sang (Blood Songs)</h1><p>Chant de guérison elfique qui agit sur la circulation et les pertes de sang.</p><p><strong>Restriction :</strong> cette Compétence est normalement réservée aux lignées elfiques. Elle est considérée comme Restreinte pour les autres peuples.</p><p><strong>Résolution :</strong> utilisez une Manœuvre de Manipulation de la Puissance. MERP-UI remplace automatiquement le résultat normal par la table spéciale des Chants de Guérison. Les modificateurs de situation, de gravité de la blessure, des chanteurs accompagnateurs et de l’affinité du patient avec les Elfes restent à appliquer dans le dialogue de Manœuvre.</p><p><strong>Modificateurs RMSS/RMFRP :</strong> situation de +30 à −70 ; nature de la maladie ou de la blessure de +30 à −70 ; jusqu’à cinq chanteurs accompagnateurs ajoutent chacun leur bonus dans le Chant concerné ; patient mortel ayant une affinité avec les Elfes : −20 ; autre mortel : −50. Ces modificateurs sont saisis dans le dialogue de Manœuvre RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Blood Songs","system":{"name":"Blood Songs","description":"<h1>Blood Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that acts upon circulation and blood loss.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":[],"en":[]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":[],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"name":"Blood Songs","category":"Power Manipulation","trainingGroup":null,"stat":"Em","description":"<h1>Blood Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that acts upon circulation and blood loss.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>","specialization":"","attackUUID":null,"specializationType":0,"hasSpecialization":false,"fixedSpecializations":false,"specializations":[],"favorite":false,"cultureRanks":0,"ranks":0,"autoSkill":false},"_id":"mS8T2ewN3PlSOwYO"}
{"name":"Bone Songs","type":"skill","img":"systems/rmu/icons/svg/iron_crown_w.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"healing-song-bone","collection":"merp-rmu","source":"RMSS/RMFRP — Healing Songs","restriction":{"race":"elf"},"resultTable":"healing-songs","englishName":"Bone Songs","compendiumSourceKey":"healing-song-bone","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-skills","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/khazad.json","compendiumFolderKey":"skills","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Chant des Os","system":{"name":"Chant des Os","description":"<h1>Chant des Os (Bone Songs)</h1><p>Chant de guérison elfique qui renforce et aide à régénérer les os brisés ou fracassés.</p><p><strong>Restriction :</strong> cette Compétence est normalement réservée aux lignées elfiques. Elle est considérée comme Restreinte pour les autres peuples.</p><p><strong>Résolution :</strong> utilisez une Manœuvre de Manipulation de la Puissance. MERP-UI remplace automatiquement le résultat normal par la table spéciale des Chants de Guérison. Les modificateurs de situation, de gravité de la blessure, des chanteurs accompagnateurs et de l’affinité du patient avec les Elfes restent à appliquer dans le dialogue de Manœuvre.</p><p><strong>Modificateurs RMSS/RMFRP :</strong> situation de +30 à −70 ; nature de la maladie ou de la blessure de +30 à −70 ; jusqu’à cinq chanteurs accompagnateurs ajoutent chacun leur bonus dans le Chant concerné ; patient mortel ayant une affinité avec les Elfes : −20 ; autre mortel : −50. Ces modificateurs sont saisis dans le dialogue de Manœuvre RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Bone Songs","system":{"name":"Bone Songs","description":"<h1>Bone Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that strengthens and helps regenerate broken or shattered bones.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":[],"en":[]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":[],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"name":"Bone Songs","category":"Power Manipulation","trainingGroup":null,"stat":"Em","description":"<h1>Bone Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that strengthens and helps regenerate broken or shattered bones.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>","specialization":"","attackUUID":null,"specializationType":0,"hasSpecialization":false,"fixedSpecializations":false,"specializations":[],"favorite":false,"cultureRanks":0,"ranks":0,"autoSkill":false},"_id":"V4xFRd0NzURbj3WY"}
{"name":"Cleansing Songs","type":"skill","img":"systems/rmu/icons/svg/iron_crown_w.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"healing-song-cleansing","collection":"merp-rmu","source":"RMSS/RMFRP — Healing Songs","restriction":{"race":"elf"},"resultTable":"healing-songs","englishName":"Cleansing Songs","compendiumSourceKey":"healing-song-cleansing","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-skills","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/khazad.json","compendiumFolderKey":"skills","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Chant de Purification","system":{"name":"Chant de Purification","description":"<h1>Chant de Purification (Cleansing Songs)</h1><p>Chant de guérison elfique qui purifie le sang et les organes et aide le corps à retrouver son fonctionnement normal après une longue épreuve.</p><p><strong>Restriction :</strong> cette Compétence est normalement réservée aux lignées elfiques. Elle est considérée comme Restreinte pour les autres peuples.</p><p><strong>Résolution :</strong> utilisez une Manœuvre de Manipulation de la Puissance. MERP-UI remplace automatiquement le résultat normal par la table spéciale des Chants de Guérison. Les modificateurs de situation, de gravité de la blessure, des chanteurs accompagnateurs et de l’affinité du patient avec les Elfes restent à appliquer dans le dialogue de Manœuvre.</p><p><strong>Modificateurs RMSS/RMFRP :</strong> situation de +30 à −70 ; nature de la maladie ou de la blessure de +30 à −70 ; jusqu’à cinq chanteurs accompagnateurs ajoutent chacun leur bonus dans le Chant concerné ; patient mortel ayant une affinité avec les Elfes : −20 ; autre mortel : −50. Ces modificateurs sont saisis dans le dialogue de Manœuvre RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Cleansing Songs","system":{"name":"Cleansing Songs","description":"<h1>Cleansing Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that purifies the blood and organs and helps the body return to normal function after a prolonged ordeal.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":[],"en":[]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":[],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"name":"Cleansing Songs","category":"Power Manipulation","trainingGroup":null,"stat":"Em","description":"<h1>Cleansing Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that purifies the blood and organs and helps the body return to normal function after a prolonged ordeal.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>","specialization":"","attackUUID":null,"specializationType":0,"hasSpecialization":false,"fixedSpecializations":false,"specializations":[],"favorite":false,"cultureRanks":0,"ranks":0,"autoSkill":false},"_id":"3p7sr6GMlKQJ1H7T"}
{"name":"Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs","type":"skill","img":"systems/rmu/icons/svg/iron_crown_w.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"healing-song-muscle","collection":"merp-rmu","source":"RMSS/RMFRP — Healing Songs","restriction":{"race":"elf"},"resultTable":"healing-songs","englishName":"Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs","compendiumSourceKey":"healing-song-muscle","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-skills","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/khazad.json","compendiumFolderKey":"skills","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Chant des Muscles, Tendons et Ligaments","system":{"name":"Chant des Muscles, Tendons et Ligaments","description":"<h1>Chant des Muscles, Tendons et Ligaments (Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs)</h1><p>Chant de guérison elfique qui répare et renforce les muscles, tendons et ligaments.</p><p><strong>Restriction :</strong> cette Compétence est normalement réservée aux lignées elfiques. Elle est considérée comme Restreinte pour les autres peuples.</p><p><strong>Résolution :</strong> utilisez une Manœuvre de Manipulation de la Puissance. MERP-UI remplace automatiquement le résultat normal par la table spéciale des Chants de Guérison. Les modificateurs de situation, de gravité de la blessure, des chanteurs accompagnateurs et de l’affinité du patient avec les Elfes restent à appliquer dans le dialogue de Manœuvre.</p><p><strong>Modificateurs RMSS/RMFRP :</strong> situation de +30 à −70 ; nature de la maladie ou de la blessure de +30 à −70 ; jusqu’à cinq chanteurs accompagnateurs ajoutent chacun leur bonus dans le Chant concerné ; patient mortel ayant une affinité avec les Elfes : −20 ; autre mortel : −50. Ces modificateurs sont saisis dans le dialogue de Manœuvre RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs","system":{"name":"Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs","description":"<h1>Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that repairs and strengthens muscles, tendons, and ligaments.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":[],"en":[]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":[],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"name":"Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs","category":"Power Manipulation","trainingGroup":null,"stat":"Em","description":"<h1>Muscle/Tendon/Ligament Songs</h1><p>Elven healing song that repairs and strengthens muscles, tendons, and ligaments.</p><p><strong>Restriction:</strong> this Skill is normally reserved for Elven lineages. It is considered Restricted for other peoples.</p><p><strong>Resolution:</strong> use a Power Manipulation Maneuver. MERP-UI automatically replaces the normal result with the special Healing Songs table. Situation modifiers, injury severity, accompanying singers, and the patient’s affinity with Elves must still be entered in the Maneuver dialog.</p><p><strong>RMSS/RMFRP Modifiers:</strong> situation from +30 to −70; nature of the illness or injury from +30 to −70; up to five accompanying singers each add their bonus in the relevant Song; mortal patient with an affinity for Elves: −20; other mortal: −50. These modifiers are entered in the RMU Maneuver dialog.</p>","specialization":"","attackUUID":null,"specializationType":0,"hasSpecialization":false,"fixedSpe